  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\n\r\nWhen I upload a media file, I would like to provide attribution as an independent field to it freestyle including author, source, license. This should also be usable for user and room avatars.\r\n\r\nExample scenarios:\r\n\r\n* User wishes to use an avatar made by [Cat Avatar Generator](https://www.peppercarrot.com/extras/html/2016_cat-generator/index.php) as their profile picture. They are licensed under CC-By license so currently their best option to follow the license would be to add that to their display name, which then is possibly ugly and accessibility issue.\r\n* A room wishes to use a GPLv2 licensed picture as their room avatar. Currently they can only append to the room topic \"Room avatar by Whoever under GPLv2 license: sourcelink\", which can become confusing with bridges, especially the IRC bridge which would likely bridge the topic over while IRC users won't see the room avatar itself.\r\n\r\n*I brainstormed the general idea with @Sorunome*",
